data-glimmer-environment-connector
==================================

Third-party content under `src/main/resources/glimmer-environments/`:

- `env_dark.jpg` — night cityscape photograph from Unsplash. Used under the
  [Unsplash License](https://unsplash.com/license). Centre-cropped to 4:3 and resized to 960x720.
- `env_busy.jpg` — Bangkok street market photograph by Bruno van der Kraan
  (https://unsplash.com/photos/a-busy-street-market-is-filled-with-people-Jtu6HGNKK7Q).
  Used under the Unsplash License. Centre-cropped to 4:3 and resized to 960x720.
- `env_venice_canal_cats.jpg` — Venice canal photograph featuring a gondolier. Used under the
  Unsplash License. Centre-cropped to 4:3 and resized to 960x720.

The Light environment is generated procedurally by the connector and has no third-party asset.
The Unsplash License permits use without attribution but does not transfer copyright; attribution
is provided here as a courtesy.
